# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# The app is a client-routed SPA, so every path that is not a real file must be
# served index.html and let React Router resolve it. Without this rule a cold load
# of a deep link (for example rudra.fitconnect.co.in/dashboard/members, or any
# gym subdomain landing page) is served 404.html instead of the app — the service
# worker's navigateFallback only covers navigations after it has installed.
#
# 200 rewrites rather than redirects, so the URL the user sees is preserved.
/*    /index.html   200
